Hi everyone,

sorry for the delay on this - as agreed in the last meeting, I have started a google doc to formulate the plans (learning outcomes, contents, etc) for the BiocProject and RNA-seq lessons: https://docs.google.com/document/d/1wMrkyTh5ItNflp7YZuVQ7dBwkdi3ije-5cOh9qRGPbU/edit?usp=sharing
